    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the worst vacation in the life of Thomas Brutus - a brutal student of a spiritual academy, who just wanted to relax, but got into a supernatural mess. It all started with the fact that his chance encounter with a witch, turned his whole life upside down.  And now he is forced to spend three nights at her coffin, fighting not only for his life, but also for the remnants of sanity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This visual novel in the best traditions of black humor and mystical horror offers the player:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Choices that affect the witch's behavior and the course of events. Will you be able to piss her off to the point of \u201ctearing her apart\u201d, or will you talk her down to \u201clight psychological torture\u201d?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- A lot of creepy, disgusting and absurdly funny situations. Excuses won't help - you'll have to answer questions, play horrifying games and come face to face with nightmares.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- A ton of weird, sarcastic and deadly dialog. Gogol's classic? Forget it! Even the shadows can joke around here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Different endings depending on your decisions. Who knows, maybe the witch will fall in love with you... Or make a stew out of you?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you willing to endure three nights of hell? Or would you rather sign your death warrant on the first? The choice is yours.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the worst vacation in the life of Thomas Brutus - a brutal student of a spiritual academy, who just wanted to relax, but got into a supernatural mess. It all started with the fact that his chance encounter with a witch, turned his whole life upside down.  And now he is forced to spend three nights at her coffin, fighting not only for his life, but also for the remnants of sanity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This visual novel in the best traditions of black humor and mystical horror offers the player:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Choices that affect the witch's behavior and the course of events. Will you be able to piss her off to the point of \u201ctearing her apart\u201d, or will you talk her down to \u201clight psychological torture\u201d?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- A lot of creepy, disgusting and absurdly funny situations. Excuses won't help - you'll have to answer questions, play horrifying games and come face to face with nightmares.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- A ton of weird, sarcastic and deadly dialog. Gogol's classic? Forget it! Even the shadows can joke around here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Different endings depending on your decisions. Who knows, maybe the witch will fall in love with you... Or make a stew out of you?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you willing to endure three nights of hell? Or would you rather sign your death warrant on the first? The choice is yours.</p>",
